Decision (G1 brand-absent) — stated
------------------------------------
Gap-fill WINS. `synthesize.py`'s `brand_absent` refusal governs LLM-emitted facts that lack payload grounding (`parse_synthesis`); this slice runs no synthesis, and the OFF snapshot IS the grounding, so mapping the payload's own `brands` is not "invention". The `isinstance` guard drops absent/empty `brands`, so population 3 emits no brand. (An empty query brand caps OFF's score at 0.55 < the 0.60 accept bar, so the brand-absent-asset population is unreachable through the endpoint — proven by direct mapper/merge unit tests instead.)

